Third-party material bundled with this distribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This distribution vendors, unmodified, artifacts from the ONMI (Open Network
Models and Interfaces) Transport API (TAPI) SDK, used to generate the endpoint
catalog and to ship schema maps into the produced datasource:

  * OpenAPI specifications  -> tapi_overlay/spec/oas/*.yaml
  * YANG tree renderings    -> tapi_overlay/spec/tree/*.tree

  Source:  https://github.com/Open-Network-Models-and-Interfaces-ONMI/TAPI
  Project: LF ONMI Transport API (TAPI) SDK
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0

See tapi_overlay/spec/PROVENANCE.md for the exact source branch and retrieval
date. All rights in those artifacts remain with their original authors.
